OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restrictions in place
OL,4,Afor at least two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt means livestock such as cattle,
OL,7,Fsheep and other susceptible ruminants
OL,8,Fwill still need a licence if they are
OL,9,Fbeing moved out of the restricted zone
OL,10,Fto the rest of Scotland.
OL,12,FAnd the restrictions will only be
OL,13,Flifted once the region has been free of
OL,14,Fthe disease for two years.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
